# Generated by scripts/generate-tray-icon.mjs and committed on purpose.
# electron-builder copies these through extraResources, and a missing
# extraResource is skipped silently rather than failing the build — so leaving
# them ignored shipped a release with no menu bar icon at all.
!build/trayTemplate*.png
!build/tray-*.png
